(Kampong Chhnang): Speaking from the Phnom Chum Sen Gendarmerie Training Center this morning, July 14, 2023, on the occasion of celebrating the 30th anniversary of the establishment of the Gendarmerie, Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Defense. Ordered the Armed Forces to be ready to cooperate with the relevant authorities to prevent any activities that would attempt to disrupt the election in Cambodia.
After noting the important achievements of the Royal Gendarmerie in the past under the command of General Sao Sokha, Deputy Commander of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and Commander of the National Gendarmerie, Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh introduced some important work, including:
* First, to manage the armed forces, equip weapons and equipment in cooperation with ministries, institutions, relevant authorities to protect security, maintain public order and social security.
During the 7th National Assembly election on July 23, 2023, officers, deputies and soldiers of the Royal Gendarmerie must participate in the election and must abide by the law. The Electoral Regulations aim to ensure that the upcoming elections are free, fair and just in order to continue to promote democracy and the development of the nation.
At the same time, it is necessary to strengthen and take appropriate measures in accordance with the law to prevent all activities that attempt to disrupt the election process, to protect the legitimate Royal Government that emerges from the election and to protect all national achievements in a sustainable manner.
* Third: Continue to promote the implementation of safe village, commune and sangkat policies to prevent crime more effectively, contribute to maintaining security and order, socio-economic development, building infrastructure, protecting natural resources, and rescuing people in the event of other disasters. Such as floods, droughts, epidemics and so on.
Continue to pay attention to the implementation of security operations, prevention, suppression and rescue of forest crime, encroachment on land and fisheries of all kinds to be more active and effective and ready to support cooperation with the competent authorities.
* Fourth: Continue to pay attention to training and retraining the skills of officers to continue their studies abroad to increase the efficiency, quality and work efficiency for the core tasks of the unit. Must be mindful of the dissemination of new achievements, new political situations and psychological political education to the soldiers of the Royal Gendarmerie, clear position, strong will, responsibility, loyalty to the nation, religion, the King and the Royal Government.
* Fifth: Manage and maintain the means, equipment, weapons, weapons and ammunition to prevent fire, damage, loss, maintain good quality for effective training and operation. Efforts must be made to maintain and repair all types of compensation, continue to complete the construction according to the plan, pay attention to the construction of new buildings in a technical manner, ensure quality and long-term use.
* Sixth: Continue to pay attention to the work of raising troops, examine and treat welfare, continue to promote the cultivation of crops, raise animals, praise and encourage the soldiers who have excelled in their duties and solve policies for officers, deputies and soldiers. Difficult.
Continue to cooperate with the Department of Engineering, Ministry of National Defense, territorial authority, cadastral expertise, manage inventory, state property, make a list of land titles, certificates of identification of property owners in each unit clearly, strengthen internal unity and strictly implement the hierarchy of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces.
Continue to participate in building the history of X-16 and according to the military history sites that the Royal Government just decided on July 7, 2023, recently, 87 locations to record and keep the symbols, exhibits and achievements for the training of gratitude consciousness. And participation as a lesson for the next generation to learn. Mr. Ouk Prachea told people to vote for the CPP to protect peace, development and ensure a prosperous future
