(Kratie): A mother was killed by lightning in Damre village, Boeung Char commune, Sambo district, Kratie province, while her son was injured and is being treated at the Sambo District Referral Hospital.
The incident happened on the evening of June 13, 2023. Sambo District Governor Kong Metta confirmed that the lightning strike killed the mother, Dim Kunthea, 36, and her daughter Tol Keo, 12, with minor injuries.
