(Kampong Chhnang): On the morning of July 14, 2023, Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Defense, presided over the celebration of the 30th anniversary of the establishment of the Royal Gendarmerie (July 14, 1993-14). July 2023).
The ceremony was held at the Phnom Chum Sen Reak Reay Gendarmerie Training Center in Samaki Meanchey District, Kampong Chhnang Province, with the participation of General Sao Sokha, Deputy Commander of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and Commander of the Royal Gendarmerie. The Ministry of National Defense and the Commander of the Capital-Provincial Gendarmerie, as well as many other distinguished guests.
The National Armed Forces were abolished, as were other institutions during the Democratic Kampuchea regime from 1975 to 1979. Between 1979 and 1993, there was no military police force, only a military sheriff who was in charge of controlling orders and reviewing military discipline.
The mission of the Gendarmerie is stated in Article 4 of Sub-Decree No. 77 as follows:
* 1: Provide administrative police activities: maintain safety, public order, social security and rescue people at all times. The Royal Gendarmerie ensures compliance with laws and regulations.
* 2: Coverage of judicial police activities: The Royal Gendarmerie is the judicial police when rehabilitated under the Code of Criminal Procedure. The Gendarmerie investigates criminal offenses, receives complaints, searches for evidence, seizes evidence, and can detain individuals who commit criminal offenses as stipulated in the law in force.
* 3: Perform missions with special military characteristics: Responsible for maintaining security, fulfilling the role of honor guard, military position and military police work in and outside the army position.
* 4: Provide strength to assist the ministries that have requested as needed.
The Royal Cambodian Gendarmerie is a specialized military unit as part of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces (RCAF). The Deputy Commander of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and the Commander of the National Gendarmerie in the past have achieved many great achievements and achievements.
General Sao Sokha is a leader who has a long-term vision, courage, and high responsibility for the tasks assigned to him by his superiors, especially to strengthen the implementation of the law to protect the Constitution and the Royal Government under the wise leadership of Samdech. Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
