Three points that Dr. Hun Manet compares for people to consider include:
First, Samdech Techo Hun Sen was afraid of a country at war and a country of instability, while Sam Rainsy was afraid of a stable country, which is why he always called for an uprising.
Second, Samdech Techo Hun Sen is afraid of unemployed people, so he tried to encourage them to invest and create jobs, while Mr. Sam Rainsy was afraid of people having good jobs, so he called on foreigners to impose economic sanctions as well as cut off EBA and GSP. .
Third, Samdech Techo Hun Sen is afraid that people will die because of Kovid 19, so he tried to find a vaccine and put in place various mechanisms, but Mr. Sam Rainsy never called on foreigners to provide vaccine assistance to Cambodia, but continued to call on foreigners to punish Cambodia.
