The video that the extremist group Asir Piseth has distorted is the video that Samdech Techo Prime Minister said on August 16, 2020 at the inauguration of "Garden City" water park by Duke Ly Yong Phat.
In the video, Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirmed three options for demarcating the border with Vietnam in relation to the land of Samdech Heng Samrin's hometown. Regarding the demarcation of the border between Cambodia and Vietnam, according to the map left by the French colony, the land of Samdech Heng Samrin's hometown was on Vietnam.
However, Cambodia and Vietnam agreed to keep the land of Samdech Heng Samrin's hometown on Cambodian territory and to exchange land at another location instead.
In the video, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also stated that the demarcation of the border according to the map left over from the French colonial period, Cambodia received about 2,000 hectares of land under Vietnamese control.
