"In the past, the Cambodia Daily has been spreading false information on Facebook with political fabrications about the situation in Cambodia, slander the leaders of the Royal Government of Cambodia, especially Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia and Samdech Kittibandit Bun. Rany Hun Sen and the prince's family.
* This newspaper distorts the drug situation in Cambodia and ignores the efforts of the Royal Government and the people of Cambodia for close international cooperation from other countries in preventing and combating drugs. The successful campaign plan of the Royal Government has received congratulations, support and cooperation from all national and international circles.
* It is the low character, immorality, resentment, and bitterness of the enemies of this newspaper, who always fabricate, slander, accuse and paint Samdech Techo and his family in order to discredit the hero, peace, patriotism as a shadow, lead the nation and the people of Cambodia.
* The dirty tricks of the Cambodia Daily can not deceive, hide the truth, reduce the trust and respect for Samdech Techo and his family by the Cambodian people, government officials, the Armed Forces.
* The publication of this cheap newspaper only shows the national and international masses more clearly the ambitions, hostile tactics, incitement, social insecurity, destruction of peace, and obstruction of Cambodia's development process.
"The National Police General Commissioner emphasized that this newspaper should re-learn the ethical journalism profession and be mindful, not just follow the incitement of the ignorant boss like now."
