(Kandal): On the 30th Anniversary of the Establishment of the Royal Gendarmerie, on July 11, 2023, Brigadier General Sam Tola, Commander of the Royal Gendarmerie in Kandal Province, organized a blood donation program to the National Blood Transfusion Center. From the force under the command of nearly 200 people and 10 people participated.
