In response, the winners expressed their happiness and deep gratitude for the permission to perform their duties and receive high guidance from the Secretary of State of the Ministry of Health before departure. Go to Japan in order to receive key orientation guidance as a concept for continuing to complete educational missions as well as work in various institutions in the future.
The Scholarship Program under the Government of Japan Grant for Human Resource Development (JDS) focuses on young civil servants who have the ability to participate in the development and implementation of socio-economic development plans in line with the policies of the Royal Government of Cambodia. Which has been leading the development of the country more and more, in all fields on the national and international stage.
