Dr. Ky Sereywat, President of the Institute of Chinese Studies and Economist of the Royal Academy of Cambodia, told Fresh News that the inflow of Chinese capital is opening up the inflow of investment to Cambodia, which is one of the main reasons for the influx. Let the Cambodian economy grow and be the basis of Cambodia's development.
