Letter to readers: 3 achievements bring "fame of Cambodian territory" to international fame in the 6th mandate
Among the many achievements, there are three important achievements that experts consider the most successful in the sixth mandate: the management of "Global Epidemic Kovid-19, the 40th and 41st ASEAN Summit in Phnom Penh and Organizing the 32nd SEA Games and the 12th ASEAN Para Games. These three great achievements have brought "fame of Cambodian territory" to the international stage in the sixth mandate.
After winning a landslide election in the sixth mandate, the new government of the Cambodian People's Party was established on September 6, 2018. In the sixth mandate, the Royal Government of Cambodia, which has many years of experience in government work, continues to bring new achievements to the motherland of Cambodia in a "win-win policy" to maintain peace, political stability and maintain good economic growth.
November in Cambodia is a cold month, but the ASEAN summit in Cambodia at a time when the world has many hot topics, such as the Russia-Ukraine war, the Kovid-19 crisis, the civil war in Myanmar, and the US-China conflict. Indo-Pacific, South China Sea disputes, etc. are all hot flashes for Cambodia to host.
After 64 years of waiting, the "32nd SEA Games" officially opened on May 5, 2023 and the opening ceremony of the 12th ASEAN Para Games on June 3 of the same year. $ 100 million to organize this event. In fact, Cambodia really wants to host this event, but because of the civil war forced to divert money to develop the nation just recovered from the war.
Cambodia used to be despised and recognized through the war, resuming its reputation through the opening and closing ceremonies of the SEA Games and Para Games. Young people and receive praise from all national and international circles.
Cambodia has never won a large number of "medals", winning a total of more than 200 medals and ranking fourth after Vietnam, Thailand and Indonesia with the best results in more than 60 years. Cambodian Para Games also won 70 medals.
