He will then follow the legal procedure, firstly: prepare a report to be sent to court, secondly, he will search for all stakeholders to bring him to justice in accordance with court procedures without exception. No, because this is not only against the law, but also strongly opposed to the order of Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
He added that he was waiting for a detailed report from the Fisheries Administration after receiving the report, and that he would prepare another report to be sent to court through the director of the provincial agriculture department. As for the perpetrators and their accomplices, he will not be released because his professional officers already have the evidence in hand and for the search to find the perpetrators and punish them according to the law.
He confirmed that during the operation, he also saw three machines in action, but when he saw his team arrive, they also fled the machine, leaving three motorcycles. Items belonging to the above group of suspects at the scene.
