(Kampong Cham): Mr. Muon Veasna, Advisor to Samdech Heng Samrin and Deputy Rector of Kampong Cham University of Management and Economics, on July 9, 2023, led the staff, trainers and students to plant trees to celebrate the 9th of July 2023 .
Mr. Muon Veasna stated that the Plant Day was determined by Royal Decree No. 738 NS dated August 8, 1952. After the day of liberation on January 7, 1979, the Department of Forestry compiled a decree on the law on forests and made this day a national holiday. Until 2002, there was a policy to define the national forest sector and based on Article 61 of the Law on Forestry, which was promulgated according to the Royal Kram dated 31 August 2002.
Mr. Muon Veasna continued that this is to celebrate the 9th of July 2023, which every year on 9th of July is a special day that the Kingdom of Cambodia always celebrates the "Tree Day" (Royal Tree Planting Ceremony) ) Under the highest presence of His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of the Kingdom of Cambodia, our highest reverence.
