Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng orders to stop stamping money from Cambodians on the Cambodian-Thai border at Poipet
(Banteay Meanchey): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior, has issued an order to stop stamping money from Cambodians who enter and leave the Cambodian-Thai border.
