According to the new development concept of Chinese Communist Party governance, "high quality development" is the main task. Xi Jinping explained that "China's economy is shifting from fast growth to high-quality development. Industries and enterprises must strictly move in this direction." How will China develop its economy with high quality? The key is to build a modern manufacturing system.
* What is the content of modern production industry system?
Defining the National Strategy of the Chinese Ruling Party Modern industrial production systems include: advanced, intelligent and green production, emerging industries, strategic strategies such as information technology, AI, biology, new energy, new materials, eco, etc. Deeply connected with modern production and modern agriculture, the digital industry is deeply connected to the real economy and modern infrastructure.
