(Preah Sihanouk): At a point on Ream Beach Road in front of Kang Keng International Airport in Thmor Thom Village, Ream Commune, Prey Nob District, Preah Sihanouk Province, three suspects attempted to snatch a bag from a woman and escaped. In the afternoon of July 6, 2023.
Immediately after receiving the information, the specialized force of Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police, in cooperation with the specialized force of Prey Nup District Police and the Ream Commune Police Station, conducted a thorough search and arrested the three suspects. The suspect knocked over the motorcycle and ran into the forest.
After interrogation, the three suspects confessed that they, along with three other accomplices, had committed 11 cases of theft in the past, including 7 cases in Sihanoukville (electric shock + motorcycle theft) and district Prey Nob 4 cases (electric shock + motorcycle theft). In the above case, the Office of Minor Criminal Police is continuing to interrogate according to professional procedures.
