(Phnom Penh): Mr. Mam Bunneang, Chairman of the Senate Commission on Investigation and Anti-Corruption (10th Commission) and Speaker of the Senate on July 05, 2023 at Phnom Penh International Airport, warmly welcomed him. Kim Jung-Nam, President of the Global Life-Sharing Fund, and a delegation visiting Cambodia today.
Mr. Mam Bunneang stated that the presence of the President of the Foundation and the delegation on this occasion is very important to maintain the foundation of cooperation between the Senate of Cambodia and the Global Life Sharing Fund to be stronger and deeper. To work together to improve the quality of life of the poor and vulnerable in Cambodia.
