The President of the Foundation added that this is the second time that he has led a delegation from the Global Life-Sharing Fund of the Republic of Korea to visit the humanitarian work in the Kingdom of Cambodia, and this activity will continue to show the effectiveness. Intimacy and the strength of the bond between each other.
On July 6, 2023, a delegation from the 10th Senate Committee, together with a delegation from the Global Life-Sharing Fund of the Republic of Korea, accompanied by experts from the General Secretariat of the Senate, paid a courtesy call on teachers. Both students at Hun Sen Monorom Primary School in Ta Nei commune, Prey Nob district, Sihanoukville province.
On that occasion, the two delegations handed over some study materials such as pencils, erasers, highlighter notebooks, shoes, taps ... etc. And some funds to the school management as well.
Then, in the afternoon of the same day, the delegation of the 10th Senate Committee together with the delegation of Global Life Sharing Fund and Mr. So Khon Rithykun, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Environment presided over the inauguration ceremony of the health care room under Supported by the Life-Sharing Fund of the Republic of Korea in Ta Nei Commune, Prey Nob District, Sihanoukville Province.
Please note that Monorom Health Care Center is a Korean charity and provides free medical check-ups for residents. Monorom Health Care Room is divided into rooms for general examination, delivery room, treatment room and many more.
