It should be noted that this case was concluded by Mr. Sam Bithy Veasna, Deputy Prosecutor of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court, who decided to uphold the charges against Mr. Lay Samnang for "illegal exploitation and money laundering."
The decision to uphold the charges was made on June 27, 2023, after the end of the trial.
Lay Samnang, Deputy Director of the Finance and Supply Department of the Ministry of Social Affairs, Former Youth and Youth Fitness and an agent of the Ministry to collect money from the bank, was arrested by the Anti-Corruption Unit (ACU) on the morning of January 11, 2023 Involved in the embezzlement of more than 1,500 million riels (more than 380,000 dollars).
