(Phnom Penh): The National Election Committee (NEC) said that on July 5, 2023, this is the fifth day of the election campaign for the 7th National Assembly election in 2023, in which political parties can stand for election. Conduct election campaigns to disseminate their policies and political programs for national development to the electorate.
