As for the campaign in the form of a meeting, only the Cambodian People's Party has acted in almost all polling stations, and this political party has also acted in slide shows, videos, concerts and performing arts in some polling stations. Also.
Separately, two political parties marched in the election campaign: FUNCINPEC marched in Siem Reap and Kampong Cham, and the Cambodian Nationality Party marched in Prey Veng.
Overall, the general situation of the political party election campaign on the fifth day went smoothly, with security, safety, good order and no violence.
