(Phnom Penh): Dr. Suon Rany, Undersecretary of State of the Ministry of Public Works and a Reserve Member of the Royal Academy of Cambodia, stated that leadership must adhere to three points in order to be effective in leading the implementation of various tasks effectively.
Leadership refers to the person who is influential in managing and managing tasks as well as developing strategies for subordinates to follow effectively and efficiently.
This statement was made by Dr. Suon Rany on the morning of July 5, 2023, when he was invited to give a lecture on "What is the value of leadership for each of us" organized by the Royal Academy of Cambodia. .
Leadership must adhere to the three points that Mr. Suon Rady mentioned, including:
* First: Leadership ability must have strong knowledge, both capital skills and solid skills, theory must be implemented to be effective. In fact, leading children in the family, parents must know how to educate children from childhood to adulthood to make people have a decent lifestyle and become a good human resource for the nation.
* Second: Moral leadership must be knowledgeable and ethical in living and leading children in the institution, work and family. Obviously, if you want your children to have a good lifestyle, parents must set a good example for their children. Do not quarrel or have domestic violence, as this will lead to emotional problems or imitate their parents.
Dr. Suon Rany stated that leadership is not just about three things, but must be flexible according to the circumstances or working conditions. Another thing to keep in mind is the "communication" of people around you and between other external environments.
Last season, Cambodia exported 3,400 tons of fresh lentils to China.
Mr. Phat Sophan Borey, Chairman of the Board of Directors of Pich Chenda Company, a company that cleans, processes and packs Mien Pailin products, told Fresh News on July 5, 2023 that after the Mien Pailin harvest season ended on April 2023 And in September 2023, farmers will start harvesting Pailin lentils in the new season for domestic supply and export, especially to the Chinese market, which may increase five to eight times.
He said that after Cambodia gained the right to export to China at the end of 2022, the Pailin longan market is better and the export of longan to China is better, while this year there are export partners from China. Interested in contacting and partnering to export more.
For his company next season, he plans to export about 100 tons per month, buying from farmers who are members of the Mien Pailin Community Union of Cambodia.
"We are working with farmers to capture data from his production so that his production chain does not overlap when overlapping harvests lead to labor shortages because we have previously lacked manpower," he said. "
He added that although Mean Pailin has a good market, the price may not increase much. However, the price does not seem to increase much, but easier to sell.
Mr. Chhim Vachira, Director of Battambang Provincial Department of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, also told Fresh News that after Cambodia started exporting Pailin longan to China at the end of last year, this year, farmers in Battambang province have maintained and expanded orders. Flowering more. He expects next season's harvest to be more productive, with exports to China expected to grow from September this season.
He added that at present, Mean Pailin community, Rattanak Mondul district, which has 2,500 hectares of good agricultural land, has been cooperating with companies from Thailand to set up a place to collect, package and export longan fruit abroad. Please be informed that Cambodia started to export fresh Pailin lentils to the national market for the first time in October 2022 after negotiating the phytosanitary requirements to open the market for more than 3 years.
