Welcoming Ceremony for Students and Teachers of Kampong Chheu Teal Institute of Technology was attended by Mr. Try Dalux, Candidate for the 7th Legislature, Mr. Heng Samnang, Deputy General Director of Try Pheap Import Export, Rovieng District Branch, Preah Vihear Province and his team. Some more.
