He said today's rally was part of a three-week campaign for the seventh parliamentary election, which kicked off on July 1. The Deputy Prime Minister expressed his pleasure to meet with the members of the party, who are all the most active, courageous and loyal leaders of the Cambodian People's Party.
The Deputy Prime Minister firmly believes that the CPP will continue to win the election on July 23, as party members have expressed confidence in the leadership and what the CPP has achieved so far. In particular, maintaining peace, national unity, unity, democracy, stability and development for the benefit of our people and our nation.
The Deputy Prime Minister continued that for Saang district, so far, more than 80,000 new members have joined the CPP. He stressed that the Cambodian People's Party has the blood of resin as a servant of the nation, serve the Cambodian people, serve the interests and protect the interests of the country, protect sovereignty and territorial integrity, safeguard peace and stability and create all conditions for development.
The Deputy Prime Minister highlighted the importance and invaluable value of peace, which is the great achievement of the Cambodian People's Party, and we have achieved over the past 25 years through the implementation of the victorious policy of Samdech Techo Director. Minister.
The Deputy Prime Minister encouraged party members to continue to lead the election campaign and mobilize their relatives and families to go to the polls and vote for the CPP on July 23.
After concluding the above program, the Deputy Prime Minister continued to meet with party members at party activities centers in three villages of Svay Proteal commune: Chong Koh Kor, Baren Leu and Baren Krom.
