Very happy! A girl from Pursat underwent heart surgery after meeting Samdech Techo
(Phnom Penh): Another girl was successfully operated on by a team of doctors by Kantha Bopha to give her hope and a new light of life after she met Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia.
5-year-old Mang Thidana lives in Tuol Makak village, Anlong Thnout commune, Krakor district, Pursat province. Due to her congenital heart disease, she is thin and does not grow up like other children.
On June 30, 2023, the mother of a working girl brought her daughter to participate in a talk show in Krakor district, which was presided over by Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
The mother carried her wish from home to bring her daughter to the living God to save her life. Therefore, he brought his daughter to sit in the front row where Samdech Techo was invited to go to the podium.
Really high luck does not disappoint. Samdech Techo always has a habit of being friendly and greeting workers who attend the program in person and also meet the girl who is suffering from heart disease. On that special occasion, the mother described her daughter's condition to Samdech Techo with tears in her eyes.
After receiving the information about the girl's condition, Samdech Techo, a leader full of Brahmanism, felt very sorry for her. Samdech Techo also donated some money and instructed Mrs. Youk Sambath, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Health, who was invited to participate in the program, to arrange for the treatment of girls.
Ms. Youk Sambath said that Monty Dana was admitted to Kantha Bopha Hospital in 2018 due to severe pneumonia. The girl is regularly seen by her doctor for congenital heart problems. But for the last year, parents have not taken their children to Kantha Bopha Hospital by appointment.
Ms. Yok Sambath said that after arriving at Kantha Bopha Hospital, doctors found that Thidana had an open heart under 5 mm in size, not yet closed, and required heart surgery to close the hole. .
After a team of doctors specializing in cardiology and surgery at Kantha Bopha Hospital evaluated the girl's general condition, on Monday afternoon, July 3, 2023, Monty Dana underwent surgery.
Ms. Youk Sambath said that the team of specialists lasted for about 4 hours. The operation was successful as a first step, with a team of specialists successfully closing the heart cavity. After the operation, the girl was in the emergency room after the operation and hoped to wake up on the morning of July 4.
Ms. Youk Sambath thanked Dr. Ky Sunty, Director of Kantha Bopha Hospital of Cambodia, the team of specialists as well as all the doctors of Kantha Bopha Hospital for their hard work and knowledge to save the girl from death. Of disease.
There is no greater joy than the joy of saving a child's life, and there is no greater merit than the joy of saving this life. After her daughter underwent a successful heart operation, the mother was overjoyed and expressed her deepest gratitude and gratitude to Samdech Techo for saving her daughter's life.
The mother of the girl, Monthy Dana, also thanked Ms. Youk Sambath and the team of doctors at Kantha Bopha Hospital for their zeal in rescuing her daughter from death. This great multiplication makes her never forget.
