For the 7th National Assembly election in 2023, 18 political parties competed. Mr. Sous Angkar led 685 CPP members to campaign in Otaki and Ta Men communes, Thmor Kol district, Battambang province.
(Battambang): On July 1, 2023, Mr. Sous Angkar, Member of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party, Deputy Chairman of the Working Group of the Cambodian People's Party visited Thmor Kol District, Battambang Province and chaired the working group to assist Otaki and Ta Men communes. Launched the election campaign for the 7th National Assembly election in 2023, with 685 CPP members from the villages of the two communes (360 in Otaki commune and 285 in Ta Men commune).
The Cambodian People's Party, the largest party, has launched a campaign at the Koh Pich Convention and Exhibition Center with a total of more than 70,000 members, led by Samdech Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin, Honorary President of the Cambodian People's Party, and Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the CPP. Cambodia. More than 400 CPP members in Koul commune, Prasat Sambo district, campaign for the 7th National Assembly election
(Kampong Thom): Mr. Chou Kolla, Chief of Koul Commune Field Team, led more than 400 CPP members in Koul Commune to open the election campaign for the 7th National Assembly Election 2023 in Koul Commune, Prasat Sambo District, Kampong Thom Province this morning. July 1, 2023.
On that occasion, Mr. Chou Kolla expressed his great pleasure and deep gratitude to the grassroots working group and all members who came together today to march in the election campaign to show support for the policy and The power of the Cambodian People's Party.
He said that this march to lead the Cambodian People's Party to victory again, which will bring the people of Cambodia peace, national unity, unity, democracy and development to serve the interests of our people and our country. .
He added that today is the opening day of the election campaign for the 7th legislature in 2023, so all members of the people in Koul commune, Prasat Sambo district, Kampong Thom province have a clear position to make the right decision in the election. Determine the destiny of the nation as well as determine its own destiny.
Finally, he asked all people to participate in the upcoming election on July 23, 2023 for the Cambodian People's Party in the 18th place.
