The Chairman of the Working Group continued that this is an important opportunity for all CPP members to show their strong and strong solidarity of party members in return for the great merits of the Cambodian People's Party through Gather support from Excellencies, Lok Chumteavs, Ladies and Gentlemen, Members and all the people.
The political program for building and defending the motherland 2023-2028 is: 1. Defending the constitutional monarchy through a liberal, multi-party democratic system of parliament to perpetuate and strengthen and expand the liberal multi-party democracy. Strengthen the society by strengthening the rule of law along with promoting respect for human rights.
2. Strengthen national unity and resolve to prevent and eradicate all forms of politics and extremist activities caused by any individual or group, individual or political organization or any hostile environment that seeks to incite national division, create social chaos and destroy peace. Causing political instability in Cambodia in a rebellious manner, completely contrary to the principles of democracy and violating the Constitution of the Kingdom of Cambodia.
4: Continue to pursue an independent foreign policy based on the law of protection of sovereignty and territorial integrity, against all forms of external interference, and build better friendship and cooperation between the Kingdom of Cambodia and all countries in the world and international organizations. And actively contribute to the causes of peace, stability, security, cooperation and prosperity in the region and the world.
