The meaningful speech of Samdech Techo Hun Sen was made this morning, July 1, 2023, on the occasion of the opening of the election campaign for the 7th National Assembly election in 2023 and the celebration of the 72nd anniversary of the founding of the People's Party. More than 70,000 Cambodians gathered at the Koh Pich Convention and Exhibition Center.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen said, "More than 44 years ago, after the historic victory of January 7 on the genocidal regime, the Cambodian People's Party has united and mourned with the people overcoming all obstacles to lead the country out." "Out of the devastating situation, we have reached the stage of development in all areas with the greatest pride."
Samdech Techo Hun Sen emphasized that in the 6th legislature of the National Assembly, the Royal Government led by the Cambodian People's Party, with Samdech Techo as Prime Minister, has firmly defended peace, stability, security and social order, which has ensured the peaceful life of the people. People, socio-economic development and the strengthening of democracy.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen claims that in the face of the epidemic of Kovid 19, the Royal Government has successfully led the fight against this deadly disease, saved the lives of the people, maintained the balance of life and economic stability and made the economy The nation can recover quickly after the Kovid 19 crisis and is back on the path to potential growth.
He added that the Royal Government has also introduced and effectively implemented a number of policy measures to boost production, increase employment and employment, strengthen public services, strengthen justice, equity and social harmony, as well as promote social protection for the people. Everyone, especially the poor and vulnerable in spirit, does not abandon any Cambodian citizen.
