This morning, on July 1, 2023, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party (CPP), made this appeal on the occasion of the opening of the election campaign for the 7th National Assembly election and the commemoration of the 72nd anniversary of the founding of the Cambodian People's Party. With more than 70,000 members gathered at the Koh Pich Convention and Exhibition Center.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also highlighted the unwavering position of the Cambodian People's Party in participating in the 7th National Assembly election in accordance with the principles of multi-party liberal democracy, strictly adhering to the laws, regulations, procedures and ethics. For the election.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also called on all party working groups to visit the capital, provinces, party committees at all levels, candidates, officials and members of the Cambodian People's Party to participate in this campaign to show the strength of Strong solidarity of our party, adhering to the noble dignity and morality.
- Vote for the CPP is for peace, democracy and development! - Vote for the CPP is for national independence, national sovereignty and full territorial integrity! - Vote for the CPP is to vote for yourself! - CPP Cambodia wins the election, the Cambodian people are the winners! Glorious Cambodian People's Party! Samdech Men Sam An Leads 15,000 CPP Members to Launch Election Campaign in Svay Rieng Province
