Minister Khieu Kanharith announces the inauguration of Stung Treng Provincial Information Director, Mr. Sun Bunthoeun, to replace Mr. Ouk Theavy
(Stung Treng): Mr. Khieu Kanharith, Minister of Information, presided over the appointment ceremony of Mr. Sun Bunthoeun as the new Director of Stung Treng Provincial Information Department to replace Mr. Ouk Theavy, who has retired. The ceremony was held on June 30, 2023 in Stung Treng province with the participation of Mr. Chheang Lak, Chairman of the Provincial Council and Mr. Svay Sam Eang, Governor of Stung Treng Province, as well as a delegation accompanying many local authorities.
