Mr. Khieu Kanharith stated that the work of information is that we can not expect others to understand the work of the Department of Information, it is important to work because we are journalists, not all. The Department of Information must cooperate with all departments around the province and all relevant institutions, because today's information is a double-edged sword, both a commodity and a weapon.
According to Minister Khieu Kanharith, the elected Information Department must be competent and popular and know how to mobilize all officials to work together to be successful, because information work can not be done alone because The information work goes deeper.
He encouraged the leaders and civil servants of the Stung Treng Provincial Information Department to continue to work together in solidarity and with the relevant departments in order to work smoothly and also strive to learn more to increase knowledge. In fulfilling the task successfully.
