(Kandal): Dr. Kao Thach, Chairman of the Farmers' Movement and Agricultural Product Marketing Working Group in Khsach Kandal, Kien Svay and Lvea Em Districts and Chairman of the Khsach Kandal District Youth Movement Working Group, on the afternoon of June 30, 2023, continued to meet with farmers. In Khsach Kandal district, Kandal province, a total of 300 people came from 12 communes in Khsach Kandal district.
