In that, Dr. wants you to think about how to try to reduce production costs by saving on the use of fertilizers by making sure to follow the technical rules and do not follow each other or the same habits. No technical standards. At the same time, HE Dr. advised the farmers to have a clear record of various expenses to let us know the profit and loss.
You grow vegetables, Dr. advises you to change the practice of growing in the field to grow in a net house, because growing in a net house allows you to get quality and cost and profit on production costs. Dr. also encourages local farmers in Khsach Kandal to participate in the Smart Agriculture Project to grow vegetables in a net house based in Chey Thom commune under the cooperation between ARDB Bank and CPP in Khsach Kandal district.
