According to Mr. Meng Vannarom, there are currently 1,360 public health facilities, including national hospitals, capital-provincial hospitals, municipal referral hospitals, districts and health centers. Services provided to CCHR cardholders include outpatient consulting services (including antenatal, postnatal, postnatal and other peripheral services) and hospitalization services.
