(Phnom Penh): Mr. Sun Chanthol, Senior Minister, Minister of Public Works and Transport, this morning, June 29, 2023, officially inaugurated the public service center of Aeon Mall Meanchey on the first floor of Aeon Mall Meanchey. Located along Samdech Techo Blvd. (St. 60 meters) in Sangkat Chak Angre Krom, Khan Meanchey, Phnom Penh to bring public services closer to the people.
