According to Heang Sotheayut, Director General of the General Department of Technology and Public Relations, all public services in the center are made through a 100% digital technology automation system that allows for systematic payments. Payments from 12 partner banking and financial institutions make it easy for the public to use the service here and in line with the digitalization era.
