This statement was made by Dr. John Narith at a press conference on "Implementation of the Health Care System through the Equity Fund System for Recreational Employees" at the Ministry of Economy and Finance on the afternoon of June 29, 2023.
He said that the estimated cost of this level is due to the fact that Cambodia currently has two health care regimes, the first is the health care system, a large number of which are in a system that is covered and Second, the fund that if he is in poverty, they will benefit from this regime.
