Serey Kosal MP Continues to Meet with People in Ponley Commune, Phnom Srok District and Calls for Election on July 23
(Banteay Meanchey): Mr. Serey Kosal, Member of Parliament of Banteay Meanchey Province, on the afternoon of June 29, 2023, continued to meet with people who are members of the People's Party and other parties, including the Candlelight Party and the National Unity Party. More than 1,500 people came to live with the Cambodian People's Party, which was organized in the compound of Wat Svay Sar, Ponley commune, Phnom Srok district, Banteay Meanchey province.
The event was also attended by Mr. Nhep Bunchin, former Minister of Labor and Vocational Training, Mr. Khlok Nouy, Deputy Governor of Banteay Chey Province, Mr. Sin Bol, Chairman of Ponlei Commune Assistance Team, Phnom Srok District, and relatives from Svay Sor Village, Kork Ta Sok Village and Po Ram Bon Village, Ponley Commune, Phnom Srok District, Banteay Meanchey Province.
Mr. Serey Kosal expressed his gratitude to the people in Ponley commune who voted for the CPP in the past and said that their participation in the political life of people from other parties is under a win-win policy. Of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, no party wins, only all who come to join the Cambodian People's Party have a peaceful nation.
Mr. Serey Kosal also mentioned the absence of the Candlelight Party from voting due to insufficient documentation. Mr. Serey Kosal gave an example of indifference to the timing of the election, which was an insult to the NEC.
He said that in fact, the Candlelight Party did not want to participate in the election because the founders of the party hid the original documents and put themselves in isolation, so the people who created the party want to stand for election only because of He could not stand for election, so he used all kinds of tricks to deceive his supporters.
At the same time, Mr. Serey Kosal mentioned the political tricks related to the past, present and future of corrupt politicians who intend to destroy the peace in Cambodia because they think that the election will not win the CPP, so they have the intention. Want their party to dissolve in order to suppress the Royal Government, put the blame on the Royal Government for foreigners to cut off aid.
Mr. Serey Kosal asked the people to believe in the Cambodian People's Party, led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister and the next candidate, Dr. Hun Manet, who brought peace and development.
In addition, he advised people to go to the polls on July 23, 2023 and vote for the Cambodian People's Party, ranked 18th, without interruption.
He told the people to believe in the policy of the Cambodian People's Party and the election if one ballot is wrong for 5 years, so please continue to support the CPP, which is the only party capable of defending peace and development. .
The event also included a 500-kilogram solidarity noodle party with 2,000 people, a happy and friendly atmosphere and a distribution of medicine.
In this ceremony, Mr. Serey Kosal also supported the construction of 2 roads and 3 sewers, as well as provided some materials, each pregnant woman received 50,000 Riels and a sarong, as well as the disabled and participants Each person receives a sarong with a budget of 10,000 riels. Tomorrow morning, Samdech Techo Hun Sen Meets Workers in Pursat Province
