Prince Kong Sam Ol Inaugurates a 90-Meter Concrete Bridge in Kampong Tralach District, Kampong Chhnang Province
(Kampong Chhnang): A 90-meter-long, 8-meter-wide concrete bridge and a 200-meter-long red gravel road connecting both ends of the bridge were officially inaugurated this morning, June 29, 2023, under the presidency of the Prince. Vor Vieng Chey, President of Sri Lanka Kong Sam Ol, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of the Royal Palace.
The ceremony was held in Stung Snguot village, Ampil Teuk commune, Kampong Tralach district, Kampong Chhnang province, with the participation of Dr. Ouk Rabun, Minister of Rural Development, Chairman of the Royal Government Working Group on Kampong Chhnang Province, Mr. Sun Sovannarith, Governor of Kampong Chhnang Province, Ladies and Gentlemen, Royal Working Group The government visited districts, communes and a large number of people.
