Samdech Chao Fah Veang mentioned the importance of this bridge, which serves the economic and social potential, for communicating social services and public services to the people in Kampong Tralach and Choul Kiri districts of Kampong Chhnang province.
At the same time, the Prince of the Royal Palace informed the message of His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of the Kingdom of Cambodia to all Cambodians to go to the polls to fulfill their duties as citizens.
With this, Samdech mentioned many achievements of the Royal Government in the field of Buddhism and the Empire, including infrastructure, roads, bridges, schools, hospitals, pagodas and many other achievements throughout the country that came from the efforts of the Royal Government. Samdech Techo Hun Sen is the leader. All these historical achievements are the result of the fruits of peace. Without peace, we would not have the opportunity to develop the nation.
The Royal Government has been taking care to upgrade rural roads from red gravel roads to rubber or concrete pavements, wooden bridges or steel bridges to concrete bridges to ensure full seasonal use. 90 meters, which we are celebrating the inauguration of now.
Prince Kong Sam Ol calls on all people to go to the polls on July 23, 2023 and vote for the Cambodian People's Party to continue to support Samdech Techo Hun Sen as Prime Minister for the 7th legislature of the National Assembly Which is ranked 18th and to continue to support Dr. Hun Manet as the candidate for Prime Minister for the future.
