Weapons ready to shoot down drones flying into Cambodian sovereignty have already been installed, as of almost 6 pm, there are no more planes entering Cambodian territory.
(Mondulkiri - Ratanakkiri): Many modern weapons ready to shoot down drones (drones) that often fly into the territory of Cambodia in the province bordering Vietnam has been installed in strict accordance with the regulations of Samdech Techo General Phkay Meas 5 Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
Speaking to Fresh News at the Cambodia-Vietnam border area on the evening of June 28, 2023, a senior officer of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces claimed that after receiving the order of Samdech Techo Hun Sen immediately this morning, there was leadership. Another emergency meeting to prepare for the launch of the drone strike operation into Cambodia.
The emergency meeting was chaired by General Ith Sarath, Joint Chiefs of Staff, Honorary General Hing Bun Heang, Deputy Commander and Bodyguard Commander, and Lt. Gen. Huot Chheang, Commander of the 1st Army Division, and several senior officers. Another picture.
The senior officer claimed that as of 6 pm, there were no reports of drones flying into Cambodian sovereignty in Ratanakkiri and Mondulkiri provinces. No. However, if the plane is seen flying again, the forces will shoot down immediately.
Please be reminded that Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, has ordered the army to use the net to shoot down drones flying into Cambodian territory for reconnaissance after seeing seven more flights last night. Samdech also blamed that the Cambodian army chief seemed too gentle, which made the terrorists sympathize and dare to fly in to violate Cambodian sovereignty. Samdech Techo Hun Sen also announced a $ 200,000 grant for any unit that shot down a drone.
