(Phnom Penh): Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Defense, on behalf of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, presides over here this morning the inauguration ceremony of the "Techo Sen Cooperative Hall". Of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport.
Techo Sen Co-educational Hall is another new achievement of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport, which was established for the purpose of organizing additional training courses on technical and related skills for management and staff, civil servants and students of the Institute. Techo Sen Public Works and Transport. The hall is 31.3 meters long and 18 meters wide and can accommodate about 230 participants.
