(Prey Veng): A brutal case that occurred in Svay Antor district, Prey Veng province, was launched by a specialized police force and successfully separated, arresting two perpetrators after they joined hands Kill a woman and her baby and burn the body and the house to turn it into a fire.
Following the order of General Dr. Neth Savoeun, General Commissioner of the National Police, the Prey Veng Provincial Police Force conducted an investigation until the suspect was identified on June 25, 2023.
The suspect continued that when they arrived at the victim's house and saw that the door was closed, they pushed the door open and found the victim, Poy Yim (called Mey Achan, also known as Khlot), lying on the bed with his son. He woke up ready to scream with the name Mom Nheb, covered his mouth and tied the victim with a rubber band until he lost consciousness, while Mom Nheb began to rape the victim. Decided.
It should be noted that immediately after the incident, the Prey Veng Provincial Police Force, led by Major General, Commissioner, Deputy Commissioner and several police officers, arrived at the scene to intervene and inspect the scene and suspected that it was a murder case. The provincial police chief also opened an investigation and asked for help from the Scientific Technical Department of the National Police and asked for help from CPU.
On June 25, 2023, at around 10:00 AM, the police force of the Technical Department and the CPU force led by Major General Tit Bonna arrived at the scene to take samples and dissect the body of the victim. Analysis concluded that the victim's body died before the fire.
Based on this conclusion, the Prey Veng Provincial Police Commissioner and many other subordinates have the basis to continue the investigation until they identified two suspects, one named Nuon Touch and the other named Mom Nheb, then the police Detained the two suspects, interrogated them for two full days, then released the results of all kinds of confessions, including evidence, time, witnesses and facts.
The two suspects are currently being held at the Prey Veng Provincial Police for the justice police to build a case to be sent to court without exception.
Stung Treng Provincial Administration and Provincial Department of Agriculture Organize "Tree Festival 9 July" 2023
(Stung Treng): On June 28, 2023, the Stung Treng Provincial Administration, in cooperation with the Stung Treng Provincial Department of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, organized the "9th July Tree Festival" under the chairmanship of Mr. Svay Sam Eang, Governor of Stung Treng Province. Provinces, members of provincial councils, armed forces of all kinds, mayors, districts, departments, units around the province, a total of 600 students.
Mr. Tum Niro, Director of Stung Treng Provincial Department of Agriculture, said that the festival is always held every year in our Stung Treng province to restore and replant the forest. In fact, from 2004 to 2023, Stung Treng Province celebrated the Tree Planting Day and planted seedlings for distribution to people and other institutions for planting every year.
He added that in 2023, Stung Treng Forestry Administration has planted and distributed about 2930 seedlings of various types for planting on both sides of the road and distributed to people and other institutions to plant in the rainy season and inspire Movement for new couples to plant one tree per person during the wedding celebration as a memento of the newlyweds.
Speaking on the occasion, Mr. Svay Sam Eang said that the Tree Day is organized every year with the main purpose of actively contributing to the development and conservation of the forest sector in Cambodia, which is invaluable. Forests are very important natural resources for sustaining human and animal life, protecting against climate change, reducing natural disasters, and providing greenery, a beautiful environment, and a valuable heritage for future generations.
On that occasion, the provincial governor requested the provincial Department of Agriculture, which has the Stung Treng Forestry Administration, in cooperation with local authorities and competent forces to take measures to prevent, eliminate and suppress the crime of clearing and burning forest land. Surround the forest land ownership of the current and other forest crimes in Stung Treng province with the highest efficiency.
At the same time, Mr. Svay Sam Eang requested the Stung Treng Forestry Administration, local authorities, local people to take care of the seedlings that have already been planted so that they can grow quickly for our common good. All together.
