(Phnom Penh): In the morning of Wednesday, June 28, 2023 in Phnom Penh, Dr. Kao Kim Hourn, Secretary-General of ASEAN, paid a courtesy call on Mr. Prak Sokhon, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation.
On that occasion, the two sides discussed ASEAN affairs, especially preparations for the 56th ASEAN Foreign Ministers' Meeting and related meetings, as well as exploring ways and means to strengthen the ASEAN region to become a focal point. Of growth in line with Indonesia's theme as chair of ASEAN this year.
