He thanked the World Intellectual Property Organization (WIPO) for its continued support and good cooperation with the Department of Intellectual Property of the Ministry of Commerce.
He added that the Ministry of Commerce has organized a workshop on "Raising Knowledge of Intellectual Property Use for Women Entrepreneurs: Branding and Product Development" organized by the Department of Intellectual Property of the Ministry of Commerce in collaboration with The World Intellectual Property Organization (WIPO) has twice participated.
