Senior Minister Sun Chanthol Presides Over the Groundbreaking Ceremony for the Cambodian People's Party (CPP) in Sampov Poun City, Kandal Province
(Kandal): Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, Minister of Public Works and Transport and Chairman of the Royal Government Working Group visited Koh Thom District and Sampov Poun City this morning, June 28, 2023, inaugurated the groundbreaking ceremony for the party headquarters. Cambodians in Sampov Poun City, Kandal Province, who plan to spend a total of $ 266,789 on construction.
The groundbreaking ceremony for the new CPP headquarters was held in Kbal Chroy Village, Sangkat Chheu Khmao, Sampov Poun City, Kandal Province, and was attended by Mr. Mao Phirun, Chairman of the CPP Committee in Kandal Province, and with the participation of many people. People, too.
Please note that the project to build the headquarters of the Cambodian People's Party in Sampov Poun will be built on an area of 50 meters by 80 meters, the building will be 12 meters by 38 meters, one floor and a tiled roof. The building has a total height of 15 meters above the road, 6 meters high, will have the height of each floor as follows: ground floor to the first floor is 3.80 meters high, the first floor to the ceiling is 4 meters high. 50 meters, the roof is 5.0 meters high.
The first floor is used for the gathering of party members, which is divided into: VIP room for waiting party and delegates, 20 square meters, forum for the party to give speeches and chat with party members , 330 square meters meeting room that can accommodate and seat a total of 306 people, one sound technical control room, 10 square meters.
The double-tiled roof and the transverse roof have a horoscope facing the north entrance, featuring the party logo and the design of the swan tail and dragon tail at the end of the roof, combined with the elegant blue surface tiles.
The party headquarters building project cost a total of $ 266,789, which is divided into the following two types of work: $ 233,828 for the construction of the building, the cost of the construction of the fence and The gate cost $ 32,970.
Nearly 6 tons of drugs seized from criminals were burned during the International Day Against Drugs (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Nearly 6 tons of drugs, drugs, chemicals and chemicals in total weight 342 tons, 257 kilograms and 618.60 grams seized from 47 drug offenses in Phnom Penh were burned during the celebration of the International Day Against Drug Abuse in Koh Pich on the morning of June 28, 2023 .
