According to the report of Mr. Chreung Khmao, the Prosecutor of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court confirmed that for a total of 6 tons, 672 kilograms, 513.17 grams. While the mixture of narcotics and chemical compounds that were destroyed by neutralization was 336 tons, 544 kilograms, 519.13 grams.
However, due to the technical and safety of the destruction, the Drug Burning Commission and the laboratory of the National Anti-Drug Authority decided to destroy the drugs in front of them by burning 5 tons of drugs and chemicals weighing 713 kg. And only 099.47 grams.
He said that the drugs, chemicals and chemical compounds that are solvents and acids and toxic chemicals can not be destroyed by incineration, the Commission on Drug Control decided to hand over to the National Authority for Combating Drugs. Addicted to neutralize and destroy technically later.
