Denmark begins training Ukrainian pilots to use F-16 fighter jets
According to Danish government officials, plans to completely discontinue the use of all 30 of its F-16 fighter jets, originally planned for 2027, have been postponed until 2025. The F-16s will be replaced by 27 F-35 fighter jets. This change will begin at the end of 2023.
The deployment and supply of F-16 fighter jets to Ukraine comes after in-depth discussions in Washington on the risks that Ukraine could use to strike targets. Russian territory that will escalate the conflict.
What role has Chinese medicine and traditional medicine played in the development of the world medical field?
BEIJING: China, with a history of more than 5,000 years, in addition to leaving a beautiful civilization and culture, has also left a valuable legacy that is useful to mankind to the present, such as medicine and traditional medicine. China.
During the "North Song Dynasty", more than a thousand years ago, an official named Song Che, an autopsy author, authored a book, The Record of the Cleansing of Injustice, a book of medical forensics. First in the world. More than 300 years later, Italian medical expert Fedeli authored the first Western medical book on forensic medicine.
Chinese medicine and traditional medicine not only focus on the treatment of diseases, but also on daily health care, especially for chronic patients or patients who do not need surgery. Because most of the traditional Chinese medicine is composed of medicinal plants, the use of traditional Chinese medicine will be effective for a long time and less harmful to health.
In general, Chinese medicine and traditional medicine have evolved with the times and modernized, so this great ancestral heritage is not only not outdated, but also brings invaluable benefits in the field. Protect the public health of China and the world, which has saved countless lives at any time.
The Ministry of Education issues a press release on the progress of the achievement of textbook writing and improvement, supported by the Innovation and Innovation Research Foundation
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports on the afternoon of June 27, 2023 issued a press release on the progress and achievements of textbook preparation and improvement, supported by the Research Fund for Innovation and Innovation for the fourth week. June 2023 Secretariat of the SOC Foundation Received a total of 895 completed textbook editing and revision textbooks.
The Innovation and Innovation Research Fund (CSFF) was established under the initiative of the Ministry of Economy and Finance and the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports to promote culture. Of research, inspiration and innovation for the benefit of education, youth and sports in response to labor markets and globalization.
Following its public announcement in October 2020, the CCHR Foundation has provided support for the preparation and revision of textbooks, which is a priority activity aimed at increasing the quantity, improving the quality and expanding the equity of the textbook. Khmer language study resources for Cambodian students and researchers.
Textbook resources that have received financial support for the preparation, writing, and refinement include: 1: Textbooks for subjects used in higher education institutions 2: Textbooks for student-teachers in teacher training institutions 3: Textbooks for Technical Education 4: Basic Textbooks for Secondary Levels 5: Textbooks by High School Writers Club Students and 6: General Reading Resources.
Twenty-one public and private higher education institutions have applied for feasibility study and provided funding to write and revise a total of 1,656 textbooks to be used at the tertiary level. The SOC Fund has examined the feasibility and supported a total of 1,565 titles.
