According to the spokesperson, for June 27, 2023, the traffic police nationwide inspected and fined a total of 238 vehicles, including 129 motorcycles and 109 vehicles of all types.
Notable offenses for motorcycles include: helmets and sign offenses. In particular, the car includes: no driver's license and violation.
Please note that for June 27, 2023, traffic accidents throughout the country also occurred 10 times, in which 7 people were killed and 6 people were injured (12 people were seriously injured). In 27 days, there were 258 traffic accidents, resulting in 117 deaths, 305 injuries (205 serious injuries).
Representative of Samdech Techo Hun Sen Meets More Than 1,300 People in Kampong Speu Province and Calls for Voting for the Cambodian People's Party
(Kampong Speu): Duke Dr. Ly Samet, Personal Adviser and Representative of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, presided over a get-together with more than 1,300 members of the Cambodian People's Party (CPP) in Komapet village, O commune. Phnom Sruoch District, Kampong Speu Province.
This program was held on the morning of June 27, 2023, accompanied by the delegation, Deputy Governor, District Governor, Prof. Dr. Sum Chhum Long, Mr. Oknha Dr. Lach Samrong, Rector of Indravitcha University, Professor of Staff of Indravitcha University and Vice Chairman of Provincial Youth Working Group and Phnom Sruoch District Youth Working Group.
Duke Dr. Ly Samet brought the message of Samdech Techo Hun Sen to all the people in Komapet village, O commune, Phnom Sruoch district, as well as throughout the province and thanked all the people who continue Support the Cambodian People's Party.
He added that in order for the country to achieve peace, political stability and development in all fields, people of voting age and whose names are on the voter list should go to the polls on July 23, 2023. This is for everyone and to vote for the Cambodian People's Party, with Samdech Techo Hun Sen as the party president and head of the Royal Government of Cambodia.
On that occasion, Duke Bandith announced his support for Dr. Hun Manet's candidacy for the next Prime Minister, emphasizing that the future of Cambodia will have a young Prime Minister, Dr. Hun Manet, who has foreign knowledge.
