Interior Ministry spokesman: 60 people arrested for criminal and drug offenses on 26 June
(Phnom Penh): At least 60 suspects were arrested in criminal and drug offenses across Cambodia on June 26, 2023 yesterday. This was confirmed by General Khieu Sopheak, spokesman for the Ministry of Interior, to Fresh News on June 27, 2023.
General Khieu Sopheak added that of the 60 suspects, 29 were arrested in 12 criminal cases and 31 were arrested in 10 drug cases.
