(Kratie): Two new school buildings with 8 rooms donated by Duterte Saigon and Phu Rieng Kratie Rubber Development Company were officially inaugurated this morning, June 27, 2023 under the presidency of Mr. Ung Sam Ath, Personal Adviser to Samdech Techo and Secretary of State of the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries.
These two new school buildings will serve the education of students in two communes: Kantuot commune, Chit Borei district and Svay Chreah commune, Snuol district.
