* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the meeting with workers is not just for the vote, but to study and set policies.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that no one could have imagined that Kampong Speu was as developed and prosperous as it is today.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the future, Kampong Speu province will have a large cement factory with a production capacity of about 2 million tons per year.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Kampong Speu province still has more economic potential.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the goal of the Royal Government is to create 300,000 jobs per year.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the southwest of the country still has great investment potential due to good connected infrastructure.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was proud and satisfied with the policy of allowing people to sell land along National Roads 3 and 4.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was satisfied with the politics, philosophy and leadership of Samdech, which led to progress. This leadership has no command from any.
General Keo Pong informed Samdech that he was not present on June 20 to celebrate the 46th anniversary of the march to overthrow the genocidal regime because he did not have an invitation.
