* Samdech Techo Hun Sen donated 30,000 USD to the mother of the baby "Khon Sen Charnai" who gave birth while attending a social gathering in Bavet to pay for the bank to build a house. Samdech Techo announces to help raise up to 3 years old by sponsoring about 1 million Riels per month.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia does not discriminate against LGBT people but does not issue a law to marry each other.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to call on workers to keep the factory safe and prevent the spread of HIV.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces the destruction of extremist political groups to avoid endangering the nation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen warns singers to be careful not to taste energy drinks, be careful of diabetes.
