830 Banteay Meanchey Health Officials Receive Certificate of Appreciation from the Royal Government of Cambodia for Combating Kovid 19
(Banteay Meanchey): 830 Banteay Meanchey provincial health officials received certificates of appreciation from the Royal Government of Cambodia for their contribution to the fight against Kovid 19, which was received on June 25, 2023.
