This morning, Samdech Techo Hun Sen inaugurated the "Judicial School Building"
"School of Justice" is the office of the Court of Appeal of Phnom Penh and the Prosecutor General of the Court of Appeal of Phnom Penh and of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court and the Prosecutor of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court.
According to Mr. Keut Rith, the new building of the Court of Justice is designed to be built in the form of a court building, which is different from the normal administrative building, following the model of the Court of Justice building, which is the former court of Cambodia in the Royal King Samdech Preah Sisowath since 1925 and is now the office building of the Ministry of Justice.
This magnificent new justice school building is 62 meters long, 60 meters wide, 8 floors high and has a total area of 23,035 square meters, as well as equipped with a technological network for working in the context of digitalization in the future. Face, too.
The construction of this building took 2 years and 6 months and cost a total of 14.6 million US dollars and was implemented by Ly Chhuong Construction & Import Export Company.
After the Court of Appeal and the Attorney General of the Phnom Penh Court of Appeal moved to the new location, the old location of the Court of Appeal and the Attorney General of the Phnom Penh Court of Appeal was returned to the Ministry of Justice for the Ministry to renovate the old building and build a new one. Perform the duties of officials of the Ministry of Justice.
