(Svay Rieng): Mr. Ly Thuch, Member of the Central Committee and Chairman of the Bavet Municipal Party Working Group, outlined 10 key leadership characteristics of Dr. Hun Manet, who is worthy to be the Prime Minister of Cambodia for the future.
The statement was made during a meeting with 871 party heads of families from Bavet Sangkat, Bavet City on the afternoon of June 24, 2023 at the Bavet City Party Office.
The 10 key leadership characteristics include:
1. A true leader: Dr. Hun Manet is loyal to the nation and the people of Cambodia.
2. An understanding leader: Dr. Hun Manet always cares and worries about the well-being of the people.
3. As a dedicated leader: Dr. is responsible for his own actions.
4. Dear Leader: Mr. Hun Manet always encourages and respects the Cambodian people.
5. A virtuous leader: Dr. Hun Manet is honest, honest and has all kinds of good character.
6. A purposeful leader: He fulfills his long-term visionary mission.
7. As a loyal leader: Dr. Hun Manet respects honesty and truth.
8. Brave leader: He is determined, daring to think and dare to do.
9. An optimistic leader: Dr. can see the long-term and future vision for the nation and the people of Cambodia.
10. A polite leader: He always puts the interests of the nation and the people of Cambodia first and is always grateful and grateful to the people.
At the same time, Mr. Ly Thuch said that after the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the leaders of the Cambodian People's Party decided to select an outstanding person who is willing and virtuous to continue to lead Cambodia, the election of Mr. Hun Manet is the prime ministerial candidate for the future.
