* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls for unity to keep the peace, so that modern children and youth do not lose opportunities and help difficulties like the previous generation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that as long as the Russia-Ukraine war is not over, excessive sanctions remain uncertain and the global economic crisis is not over.
