(Phnom Penh): Mr. Lao Tith Seiha, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction, on June 23, 2023, stated that during the first five months of 2023, Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction has issued construction permits. 1,463 projects with an investment of more than 2,270 million US dollars, up 138 percent from the same period last year.
