Mr. Lao Tip Seiha stated that "In connection with the work of issuing construction permits within the framework of the country within 5 months, the Ministry has issued permits for the construction of 1,463 projects with an area of more than 5 million square meters and investment capital. "More than 2,270 million dollars, compared to the first five months of 2022, an increase of 138.52%."
