Mr. HUN MANY: Repeated actions that forced me to take a firm stand on immoral politics
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Hun Many, President of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, on the afternoon of June 23, 2023, strongly condemned the repeated insults to his family, especially to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister. Of Cambodia at once.
"Repeated actions have forced me to take a firm stand on immoral politics.
As a child, I could not tolerate the use of profanity in the lives of my family by unscrupulous people from the opposition. Repeated insults like this are unethical and absolutely unforgivable.
What kind of politics is this? Is this a policy that we can all accept? Politics usually has its limits, that is, competition with ethics and responsibility, with a clear understanding of the boundaries between social and personal aspects.
For such immoral politics, what choice do I have to make besides taking a clear and decisive stand against these unscrupulous people? Over the years, you have repeatedly taught me that it is not enough to think politically in the interests of the nation and the people, especially in politics with people like you. I do not abandon the interests of the nation and the people, but for you, there must be other measures that are in line with your character.
"People and especially young Cambodians know my character, but you are teaching me to do hot politics."
