The Cambodian Entrepreneurship Assistance Program aims to provide funding to Kovid 19-impacted SMEs to maintain their balance and seize new business opportunities in their respective sectors. The Export Market Development Program aims to provide funding to small and medium enterprises that have been planning to bring potential Cambodian products to overseas markets.
