Another family of Candle Party activists in Koh Sotin district, Kampong Cham province, wants to join the political life with the Cambodian People's Party
(Kampong Cham): Another family of former Candle Candle Activists in disbelief decided to drop the sign in front of their house to join the political life with the Cambodian People's Party.
