Mr. Pak Leang's family claims that the leaders of their old party are not responsible for their activists, have fled the country and have been using fraudulent policies for many years.
Seeing the actions of three generations of treacherous leaders, they decided to resign and drop the banner of the Candlelight Party to rejoin the political life with the Cambodian People's Party from now on, they feel that now and then. In the future, there is only one Cambodian People's Party that brings real peace and development to the people and the nation. Mr. Eang Sophalleth: Khmer loves each other, Khmer unity, Khmer wins, maintains peace and development
