* The second time, March 6-7, 2023 in Stung Treng province, with the participation of Stung Treng, Ratanakkiri, Mondulkiri and Kratie provinces.
* The third time, April 6-7, 2023 in Siem Reap, with the participation of Siem Reap, Banteay Meanchey, Kampong Thom, Preah Vihear and Oddar Meanchey.
* The 4th time, April 27-28, 2023 in Preah Sihanouk Province, with the participation of Preah Sihanouk Province, Koh Kong Province and Kampong Speu Province.
* 5th time, June 5-6, 2023 in Kampong Cham province, with the participation of Kampong Cham, Tbong Khmum, Prey Veng and Svay Rieng provinces.
* The 6th time, June 15-16, 2023 in Battambang province, with the participation of Battambang, Pailin, Pursat and Kampong Chhnang provinces.
