(Phnom Penh): The Royal Government of Cambodia has been actively working to address the issue of child exploitation and abuse. This is according to Mr. Yem Channarom, Deputy Secretary General of the General Secretariat for Combating Human Trafficking of the National Committee for Combating Human Trafficking of the Ministry of Interior.
He made the remarks when Ms. Chou Bun Eng, Permanent Vice President of the National Committee for Combating Human Trafficking, held a workshop to consult and verify the report on the situation of child exploitation in Cambodia on June 20, 2023 at the restaurant. Tonle Bassac 2 with Terre des Hommes.
